  "description": "YIJXEU01 crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C96 H80 Gd4 O33 Si16 6-,6(Na1 1+),10(C2 H6 O1),8(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd1B (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd2B (Gd) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.567-5.158 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 89.65-180.00°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula Na6{[(C6H5SiO2)8]2Gd4(μ4-O)}·10EtOH·8H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
